Rāvaṇa harshly rebukes well-spoken Vibhīṣaṇa --- Rāvaṇa prefers rival snake to foe-serving kin --- Rāvaṇa says kinsmen malign envied leaders --- Rāvaṇa cites elephant verses on dreadful selfish kin --- Rāvaṇa cites cattle maxims rues envied sovereignty --- Rāvaṇa shames high-born Vibhīṣaṇa as disgrace --- Vibhīṣaṇa leaps skyward with four Rākṣasas --- Vibhīṣaṇa says doomed reject wholesome unpleasant counsel --- Vibhīṣaṇa refuses watching brother slain by Rāma --- Vibhīṣaṇa bids farewell urging self and city guard